# Line endings are part of the contract here: dataset_contract.json stores the sha256 of
# clean_data.csv, and hv.config.CSV_KW writes it with "\n". A Windows checkout used to turn those
# into CRLF, which changed the hash on one machine and not on the other (D-M2-1 in PROJECT_LOG.md).
# Store and check out every text file with LF, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary inputs are never touched
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
